---
description: Route ad/creative requests through Ad Intelligence one-shot path
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks for ads, creatives, hooks, UGC, TikTok/Meta/YouTube spots,
launch films, storyboards, or “make ads that don’t look like AI slop”:

1. Use the **ad-intelligence** skill (`.cursor/skills/ad-intelligence` → `skills/ad-intelligence/SKILL.md`).
2. Follow `prompts/one-shot.md` — Concept first, then dense beats, craft, lint.
3. Run:
   - `node skills/ad-intelligence/scripts/start-package.mjs --out packages/<brand>-ad.md`
   - `node skills/ad-intelligence/scripts/retrieve.mjs --niche <n> --platform <p> --limit 5 --compact`
   - `node skills/ad-intelligence/scripts/lint-package.mjs packages/<brand>-ad.md`
4. Do not deliver chat-only brainstorms or unfilled `[[BRACKETS]]`. Ship a lint-clean package file.
5. Never invent proof or Seedance/Higgsfield job ids.
